driving experience. Show off your skills, climb the online leaderboards, and reign as the ultimate champion.\n\nChoose from over 12 meticulously detailed, massive trucks, each with unique cabins and authentic mechanics. Whether it's the agile Unimog U1 550L, the sophisticated MAN TGS 35.480, or the robust Hummer H1, Offroad Truck Simulator: Heavy Duty Challenge caters to all trucking preferences.", "summary": "Experience unparalleled offroad driving in Offroad Truck Simulator: Heavy Duty Challenge. Travel through the breathtaking landscapes of Utah's rugged terrain, delve into the dense European forests, and dominate diverse terrains in France, Poland, Austria, and Iceland. This game delivers an exhilarating off-road experience with an extensive fleet of massive and formidable trucks.", "themes": [{"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/offroad-truck-simulator-heavy-duty-challenge", "videos": [{"id": 103893, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "bb5bX8wwjGc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bb5bX8wwjGc", "title": "Offroad Truck Simulator: Heavy Duty Challenge | Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bb5bX8wwjGc/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}